# A test in front of a call through a table of methods, of several classes.
# f1 = use
# RUN(FORM): walk f1:Body mechanisms=all
# FORM: = ShapeTest
# FORM: = CallTable
# RUN(RIGHT): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# RIGHT: 5;7;1;10;TypeError;
# RIGHT-NEXT: went on
# RIGHT-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(ASKED): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime,UnderstateEffects:Callee/f1/ShapesKnown
# ASKED: found object in a value narrowed by a branch
# ASKED-NOT: went on
# ASKED: crashed with
